==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[High Countess Koryessa]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage. On the opening enemies, build up [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cats]], [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]], while using [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Rangers]] to tank. Once you summon the boss, it's quite easy to disregard all of the Kories' gimmicks entirely using [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] or any other Wave Shield. If you're lucky, you can stunlock High Countess Koryessa at the enemy base and immediately kill her for the easy win. Even if you're not, none of the enemies pose even the slightest threat at this point in the game, so you can play the long con and wait until she's isolated to strike. A constant deployment of Can Can Cats, Pizza Cat and Octopus Cat will make breaking through an inevitability.

